{"3743680": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MEOWU ISLAND", "steam_appid": 3743680, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0f6d658c42d06fddc32d08a558fcb8bc.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0f6d658c42d06fddc32d08a558fcb8bc.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0f6d658c42d06fddc32d08a558fcb8bc.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a warm, cozy, relaxed yet lively island life! Meet AI cats with emotions, personalities, and memories. They may come over to play, keep you company, act affectionate, get jealous, or even throw a little tantrum. Farm, fish, gather resources, decorate your home, and run the island together with your cats, turning every day into a laid-back adventure that belongs to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/b89626e5d430460e0c9da8d2c973bcc4.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=1084 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/b89626e5d430460e0c9da8d2c973bcc4.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/b89626e5d430460e0c9da8d2c973bcc4.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI cats by your side, so island life never feels lonely!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cats on the island are not characters who simply wait for commands. They have their own preferences, rhythms, and little habits. As you spend time together, they will gradually get to know you, and by working side by side, you can raise affection and slowly turn the island into a place you share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0e9519212fa6f1fc5d8a38dcc18f73fd.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0e9519212fa6f1fc5d8a38dcc18f73fd.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0e9519212fa6f1fc5d8a38dcc18f73fd.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing, farming, and gathering resources!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island life grows through hands-on work. You can plant crops yourself, fish by the sea, and gather all kinds of materials. You can also entrust tasks to reliable cat companions. They will help with everyday work, keeping island development moving forward step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/882e0afc6072182d24c431d1a69a9cd8.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/882e0afc6072182d24c431d1a69a9cd8.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/882e0afc6072182d24c431d1a69a9cd8.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than hoarding, build your ideal island!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the fish you catch, the crops you grow, and the materials you gather into island development. Build facilities, cook dishes, welcome visitors, and gradually unlock new areas and features, turning a quiet corner into a lively, thriving seaside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/49d11fbb341fc5e82c74af8bd5107285.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/49d11fbb341fc5e82c74af8bd5107285.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/49d11fbb341fc5e82c74af8bd5107285.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online co-op, share happy moments!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports online multiplayer. Invite friends to your island, tour each other’s homes and builds, and exchange tips on raising cats and managing the island. Whether you’re doing daily tasks together or joining party events, you can create unique memories of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/de3a152bd0c7ca9d1ae6608583e1864d.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/de3a152bd0c7ca9d1ae6608583e1864d.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/de3a152bd0c7ca9d1ae6608583e1864d.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0f6d658c42d06fddc32d08a558fcb8bc.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0f6d658c42d06fddc32d08a558fcb8bc.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0f6d658c42d06fddc32d08a558fcb8bc.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a warm, cozy, relaxed yet lively island life! Meet AI cats with emotions, personalities, and memories. They may come over to play, keep you company, act affectionate, get jealous, or even throw a little tantrum. Farm, fish, gather resources, decorate your home, and run the island together with your cats, turning every day into a laid-back adventure that belongs to you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/b89626e5d430460e0c9da8d2c973bcc4.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=1084 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/b89626e5d430460e0c9da8d2c973bcc4.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/b89626e5d430460e0c9da8d2c973bcc4.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI cats by your side, so island life never feels lonely!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cats on the island are not characters who simply wait for commands. They have their own preferences, rhythms, and little habits. As you spend time together, they will gradually get to know you, and by working side by side, you can raise affection and slowly turn the island into a place you share.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0e9519212fa6f1fc5d8a38dcc18f73fd.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0e9519212fa6f1fc5d8a38dcc18f73fd.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/0e9519212fa6f1fc5d8a38dcc18f73fd.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing, farming, and gathering resources!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Island life grows through hands-on work. You can plant crops yourself, fish by the sea, and gather all kinds of materials. You can also entrust tasks to reliable cat companions. They will help with everyday work, keeping island development moving forward step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/882e0afc6072182d24c431d1a69a9cd8.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/882e0afc6072182d24c431d1a69a9cd8.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/882e0afc6072182d24c431d1a69a9cd8.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than hoarding, build your ideal island!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the fish you catch, the crops you grow, and the materials you gather into island development. Build facilities, cook dishes, welcome visitors, and gradually unlock new areas and features, turning a quiet corner into a lively, thriving seaside town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/49d11fbb341fc5e82c74af8bd5107285.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/49d11fbb341fc5e82c74af8bd5107285.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/49d11fbb341fc5e82c74af8bd5107285.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online co-op, share happy moments!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports online multiplayer. Invite friends to your island, tour each other’s homes and builds, and exchange tips on raising cats and managing the island. Whether you’re doing daily tasks together or joining party events, you can create unique memories of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/de3a152bd0c7ca9d1ae6608583e1864d.poster.avif?t=1784884983\" width=780 height=430 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/de3a152bd0c7ca9d1ae6608583e1864d.webm?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743680/extras/de3a152bd0c7ca9d1ae6608583e1864d.mp4?t=1784884983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Meow Island is a management simulation game where you run an island with AI cats. Start from an undeveloped little islan